<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- Margi Tiwi Ənga Tǝm [mfm]</book>
  <para style="h">Timathlawusu Nǝ Mǝthlǝu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tim Mǝth</para>
  <para style="toc2">Timathlawusu Nǝ Mǝthlǝu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tsǝfǝ Anǝ Timathlawusu Nǝ Mǝthlǝu</para>
  <para style="mt2">Cama Tsǝtsǝfǝ Nǝ Bulusu Nǝ Mǝthlǝu Anǝ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timathlawusu</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1"/>
  <para style="s">Usa Dzau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1"/>Cama tsǝtsǝfau sara ara Bulusu, Cama sǝsǝ nǝ Kǝrsiti Yesu kǝra Hyal caɗǝbiya. Hyal ngǝ sǝwa ɗa aga ya nana ndǝr ar kǝra alkawal nǝ pi kǝra wu Kǝrsiti Yesu.<verse eid="2TI 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2"/>A nda nǝ Timathlawusu, zǝr huɗa yau.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 1:2">Mayiwakur, ǝnga tǝhuɗǝu, ba jamǝkur sara ara Hyal Tada ǝnga Kǝrsiti Yesu Thlagǝr mǝna nggya ǝnga gau.<verse eid="2TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tsǝtsǝku Ɗǝfu Nǝ Nggya Wu Mbǝrsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3"/>Yu usaku anǝ Hyal, kǝra ya vǝr sǝm mafakur anǝ nyi, ǝnggǝr kǝra ǝji ɗaˈyar sara vǝr mǝl. Yu sǝm mafakur anǝ nyi ǝnga kǝr papalǝu. Ya vǝr ɗǝnga ngau cumu ma yu ndǝr ǝnga Hyal vuˈyi ǝnga pǝci. <verse eid="2TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4"/>Ma yi ɗǝngari ǝnga pǝ sǝlǝm ngau, ba ya cim aga ya lar ngau, aga ya nyabiya dzau ǝnga huɗǝ pipida gagaɗau. <verse eid="2TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5"/>Yi ɗǝngari ǝnga mbǝrsa ngau nǝ jijiri, kǝra aˈyi ara ǝji ngǝ mala Loyisu ba ǝnga mǝ ngau Yunisu. A sǝn yau abǝr mbǝrsa kau aˈyi ara gǝ tsu. <verse eid="2TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6"/>Agabangau, ca ngǝ sǝra ɗa yu ɗǝngari ngau aga ga mbǝbiya uˈu wu barka nǝ Mambǝl kǝra Hyal nǝ ngau ar pǝci kǝra yi fǝnggǝr ngǝ tsi nǝ barka. <verse eid="2TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7"/>Ara Hyal aˈyi nǝ mǝn mambǝl nǝ hivǝr mai, ama mambǝl nǝ dǝnama, ǝnga nǝ yiwudzau, ba nǝ kǝkǝya kǝr tsu.<verse eid="2TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8"/>Agabangau, ga sara sǝli ara lǝ sakida ar kǝra Thlagǝr mǝn mai, ǝnga tsu ga sara sǝli ar kǝra yau ndǝra nji fuwa wu fursǝna arya ja mai. Ama ga daɓǝri kǝr ǝnga yau wu sa ɓwaɓwatǝ, arya ndǝshigu mǝsahǝu, kǝra wu shili wu lagu dǝnama nǝ Hyal. <verse eid="2TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9"/>Naja ngǝ mbǝɗana mǝn ǝnga ji ngga mǝn aga mǝna nggya cicau. Najaka ngga aˈyi arya vanyi sǝ mǝnahǝu kǝra mǝn mǝliya mai, ama ara sǝra ji mbiya wu mayiwakur nyi. Najaka mayiwakur, kǝra Hyal nǝ mǝn ngau lagu Kǝrsiti Yesu kadivira duniya dzǝguya dzau. <verse eid="2TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10"/>Ama kabangǝkau najaka mayiwakur a cabiyar dzau lagur shida nǝ ndǝr mbǝɗa mǝn, Kǝrsiti Yesu. Naja ngǝ ndǝra sana liya tau ǝnga ji nǝ mǝn pi, pi nǝ gǝra kuɗau lagur ndǝshigu.<verse eid="2TI 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11"/>Wu lagu ndǝshigu kau ngǝ Hyal caɗǝbiya ɗa aga ya ɗa ndǝr tǝtǝlna ndǝr Hyal ǝnga cama sǝsau ba ǝnga malǝmǝ tsu. <verse eid="2TI 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12"/>Ca ngǝ sǝra ɗa ya vǝr sa ɓwaɓwatǝ kǝra ya vǝr sa kau. Ama alaga abangau sǝli wu tǝ ɗa mai, ara a sǝn yau ndǝra yi hǝnggǝri ǝnga ja, ba ǝnga gǝra kǝpal ju sǝn ɓǝlari sǝra ji fuwa wu tsa yau baˈa shili ar pǝci ta.<verse eid="2TI 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13"/>Sǝra gǝ nggari sara ara yau, ga sǝɓiya ar viya highiɓǝ nǝ tsapǝu. Ga mǝl abangau wu mbǝrsa ǝnga yiwudzau wu Kǝrsiti Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14"/>Ga sǝɓiya ndǝshigu kǝ ɓaɓalu kǝra Hyal fuwa wu tsa gau, ǝnga tsu ga sǝɓiya ǝnga dlǝwa dzau nǝ Mambǝl Cicau kǝra a vǝr nggya wu mǝn.<verse eid="2TI 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15"/>Gu sǝn abǝr kalar ndau wu ˈyiˈyir Asǝya a piyar ɗa ri, patǝ ǝkkǝˈyi Fejilusu ǝnga Hamojinisu.<verse eid="2TI 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16"/>Bǝgǝ Thlagǝu a canǝ nyi tǝhuɗǝu anǝ njir ki Onesiforosu, arya cimǝu ju tsǝtsǝkuri ɗǝfuwa yau, ǝnga naji sǝli ara nayi ndǝr fursǝna mai. <verse eid="2TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17"/>Ar viya abangau, ǝnggǝra ji shili wu Roma, ba ji gu gal ɗa ɓakǝɓakǝu kǝlta ji thlǝwa ɗa. <verse eid="2TI 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18"/>Bǝgǝ Thlagǝu a canǝ nyi tǝhuɗǝu gagaɗau ar pǝci ta, pǝci kǝra Yesu ɓǝra nda sha shida aga numa. A sǝnǝr hyi culi vala dzǝ pamǝpamǝ kǝra ji nǝ ɗa ar pǝci kǝra yu Afisa.<verse eid="2TI 1:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2"/>
  <para style="s">Soja Nǝ Kǝrsiti Kǝra Nju Fiyafǝ Ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1"/>Nagǝ tsu zǝr ɗa, ga ɗa nǝnau lagu mayiwakur nǝ Hyal kǝra aˈyi wu Kǝrsiti Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2"/>Patǝr sǝra gǝ nggari ya vǝr na wu mwar sakida gangǝu, ga highiɓǝr nyi anǝ njira nju fiyafǝ ǝnga nda aga nda highiɓǝr anǝ alenyi nji.<verse eid="2TI 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3"/>Ar viya soja tsapǝu nǝ Kǝrsiti Yesu, ga sǝsǝˈwuri ɓwaɓwatǝ ǝnga ˈya. <verse eid="2TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4"/>Soja kǝra a vǝr mǝl thlǝr nyi aˈyi a kyaga fuwa kǝrnyi wu vanyi thlǝr mai, ama wu ɗǝfuwa ja, ja pina huɗa ndǝra dǝgal a dar kǝra ja. <verse eid="2TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5"/>Abangǝ tsu, lagur pǝra pǝra nǝ hwi, ndǝr sǝmku nuba nǝ hwi aˈyi mai, kǝl ma ji hwi tsaˈa ǝnga sǝr ɓǝla nǝ hwiya nyi na. <verse eid="2TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6"/>Ndǝr zǝwa ǝnga jiri, naja nga kyaga dzǝguya sǝm sǝr huɗa fa nyi nǝ tanggǝrma. <verse eid="2TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7"/>Ga ɗǝnga sǝˈyar kǝ ya vǝr na kau, arya Hyal ngu nda nǝ ngǝ nggabiya nda patǝu.<verse eid="2TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8"/>Ga ɗǝngari ǝnga Yesu Kǝrsiti, sara wu culi gǝ Dawuda, ndǝra hyaˈari sara vir tau. Najakǝ ngǝ ndǝshigu ɗa. <verse eid="2TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9"/>Arya ndǝshigu kau ǝnga ya vǝr sa ɓwaɓwatǝu, baˈanǝ shili ar mba ar sǝˈyi liyangǝ dǝgǝ ndǝ batal. Ama ndǝr sǝn mbiya ndǝr Hyal aˈyi mai. <verse eid="2TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10"/>Agabangǝ yi sǝsǝˈwuri sǝˈyar kǝ patǝ arya nji ɗǝɗǝm njir nu Yesu, aga nanda tsu nda uya mbǝɗau lagur Kǝrsiti Yesu ǝnga nda gu kadakadarkur nǝ baˈanuwa.<verse eid="2TI 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11"/>Kǝja ndǝr kǝra nja fiyafǝ ǝni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">Ma mǝn tǝ ǝnga ja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">mǝnu nda nggya ǝnga pi ǝnga ja.<verse eid="2TI 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12"/>Ma mǝn sǝsǝˈwuri ɓwaɓwatǝu arya ja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">mǝnu nda sǝm tǝlkur ǝnga ja.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">Ma mǝn kǝpalna sǝnǝ nyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">naja ma ju nda kǝpalna sǝnǝ mǝn tsu.<verse eid="2TI 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13"/>Ma namǝn ngǝ nji kǝra ji gǝra fiyafǝ ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:13">ama ju nggya ndǝra mǝnu fiyafǝ ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:13">ara naja aˈyi ndǝr miya mǝthlǝ mai.<verse eid="2TI 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ndǝr Mǝl Thlǝr Kǝra Hyal Fiyafǝ Nǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14"/>Ga dumwa ǝnga ɗǝngar nda sǝˈyar kau. Ga kughiya nda wu mwar Hyal ar kǝra shasha ndǝr abǝr aˈyi ǝnga akkǝri mai, ama kǝl ndza njira wu sǝhimi nda wacu. <verse eid="2TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15"/>Ga nǝrdzau aga ga cabiya kǝrngau anǝ Hyal ar viya ndǝr mǝl thlǝr kǝra Hyal dlǝwuri. Ga ɗa ndǝr mǝl thlǝr kǝra wu sǝn hǝbiya kǝrnyi sara wu sǝli wu mwar Hyal. Ga ɗa ndǝra wu sǝn highiɓǝri sǝra jiri. <verse eid="2TI 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16"/>Ga tǝkǝbiya dzau ǝnga ndǝr papatagǝu nǝ diɗa ndǝr Hyal, ara njira fuwa kǝrnda a gwagwa, ndu dumwa ǝnga maˈyi naɗǝu ǝnga gǝra hivǝr Hyal. <verse eid="2TI 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17"/>Highiɓǝr nda wu tǝtǝlnakǝr ǝnggǝr gyakǝma. Wu pama nda ngǝ culi nji ǝnggǝr Himaniyasu ǝnga Fǝlayitusu, <verse eid="2TI 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18"/>njira piyari lagu jiri. Ndu na abǝr hyaˈari sara vir tau a tǝrabiyari, lagu kau nga ndu ndzana mbǝrsa nǝ alenyi nji.<verse eid="2TI 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19"/>Alaga abangau fǝ hyi ɓaɓal nǝ Hyal a taˈyiri baˈanuwa. Hyal ǝnga kǝrnyi a fǝri mǝtsamǝ ar kǝra fǝ hyi ɓaɓal nyi kau, kǝra wu na, abǝr, “Thlagǝu wu sǝni njira nǝ nyi ngau,” ǝnga “Kalar ndǝra wu na abǝr naja nǝ Thlagǝu, kǝl ji piyari mǝl sǝra ɗǝmwaˈyu.”<verse eid="2TI 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20"/>Wu ki dǝgal ǝhya sǝm sau aˈyi kǝra nji mǝliya sara wu ǝndzau ǝnga thladla, alenyi tsu sara wu wu, ǝnga sara wu ˈyiˈyi tsǝkwaɓǝu. Alenyi nǝ mǝl thlǝr mǝnahǝu ǝnga alenyi tsu nǝ thlǝr kǝra didiɗi. <verse eid="2TI 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21"/>Ma ndǝra cina kǝrnyi sara ara sǝ didiɗiˈyar kau, ju ɗa kar thlǝr kǝra mǝnahǝu, kǝra cicau, kǝra ǝnga vala dzǝ anǝ thlagǝ nyi, kǝra nji mǝliya cipǝu aga mǝl kalar thlǝr kǝra tsapǝu.<verse eid="2TI 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22"/>Ga hwinakǝr naɗǝu sara ara sǝra wu dla ǝnga suna nǝ sǝsukur nǝ wazhakur. Ga fuwa kǝr wu gal sǝra wu dla ǝnga mǝnahǝkur, ǝnga mbǝrsa, ǝnga yiwudzau ba ǝnga jamǝkur daɓǝ ǝnga njira wu ngga thlǝmǝr Thlagǝu sara wu ɗǝfu pǝrtǝu.<verse eid="2TI 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23"/>A sara sa daɓǝr hyi ǝnga kǝpal nǝ kurthlǝ ǝnga ndǝr didiɗi mai, ara wu sǝni gau abǝr culi kau a dla ǝnga bwari wacu. <verse eid="2TI 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24"/>Aˈya kyaga mafa Hyal ja ɗa ndǝr bwari mai, ama ja kyaga ɗa ndǝr tǝhuɗǝu ǝgya kalar ndau, ǝnga ja ɗa ndǝr sǝn highiɓau ǝnga ndǝra gǝra ndzǝ ɗǝfu. <verse eid="2TI 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25"/>Njira wu kǝpal ǝnga ja, kǝl ja ndǝr anǝ nda ǝnga hangǝkal, tara ba Hyal a nǝ nda lagu nǝ tubi nda sǝnbiya lagu nǝ jiri. <verse eid="2TI 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26"/>Aga nda daɓaga sha a shili wu hangǝkalǝr nda, aga nda biya sara wu lǝbam nǝ shatan, ndǝra mbar nda aga nda mǝl sǝra ju yiwu.<verse eid="2TI 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3"/>
  <para style="s">Nggyabiya Nǝ Gǝra Hivǝr Hyal Wu Kuɗiyar Duniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1"/>Ama ga kyaga sǝni, abǝr ar pǝcir kuɗiyar duniya, nggyabiya wu nda ɗa dzadzau gagaɗau. <verse eid="2TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2"/>Ara nju nda ɗa njir yiwu kǝrnda, ǝnga njir yiwu gǝnna, ǝnga njir fǝ kǝrnda, ǝnga njir ɓwadzau, ǝnga njir nggǝl nji, ǝnga njira gǝra gǝnggǝr nyi sǝli anǝ njir yar nda, ǝnga njira gǝra na usaku, ba ǝnga njira gǝra hivǝr Hyal. <verse eid="2TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3"/>Ənga tsu njira gǝra yiwudzau, ǝnga njir sǝɓǝ ndǝ wu ta, ǝnga njir ndza thlǝmǝr ndau, ǝnga njira gǝra sǝn ɓǝlar kǝrnda, ǝnga nji shishi, ba ǝnga njira gǝra yiwu sǝ mǝnahǝu. <verse eid="2TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4"/>Ətsu ndu ɗa njir thlǝ hya ndau, ǝnga njir mǝl sǝ ǝnga kusa, ǝnga njira nyabiya dzau ǝnga kǝrnda, ǝnga njir yiwu duniya a ndiya yiwu Hyal. <verse eid="2TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5"/>Abangǝ tsu ar babal ndu mǝl sǝ ǝnggǝr njir nu Hyal, ama wu lagur nggyabiyar nda ndu kǝpalna dǝnama nǝ Hyal. Culi nji kau, ga sara daɓǝ kǝr ǝnga nda mai!<verse eid="2TI 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6"/>Wu pama nda tsu, alenyi nji aˈyi kǝra wu gal lagur vu ki nji aga nda vuwa nggutana mathlǝkǝˈyi kǝra aˈyi hahangǝ mai, ǝnga mathlǝkǝˈyi kǝra maˈyiri naɗǝu wu bikau ǝnga tsu suna sǝ ɗǝmwaˈyiˈyar pamǝpamǝ hǝna hangǝkalǝr nda. <verse eid="2TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7"/>Nanda ngǝ mathlǝkǝˈyi kǝra cumu ndu highiɓǝ sau, ama nandǝ wu sǝn tǝkǝbiya wu pama jiri ǝnga fati mai. <verse eid="2TI 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8"/>Ənggǝra Janusu ǝnga Jambǝrasu nggǝl ara mǝl sǝra Musa wu na, abangǝ tsu ngǝ nji kǝ nggǝl ara nu sǝra jiri. Nanda njira ɗǝngar nda a tǝwari, agabangǝ mbǝrsa kǝra ndu highiɓǝ kau nǝ ngguta nji ngau. <verse eid="2TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9"/>Ama sǝr mǝla nda kau wu nda maˈyi naɗǝ mai, ara ǝnggǝra dzakura Janusu ǝnga Jambǝrasu ɗa ar babal, abangǝ tsu ngǝ nǝr nda wu nda ɗa anǝ kalar ndau.<verse eid="2TI 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bulusu Kughiya Timathlawusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10"/>Kabangǝkau Timathlawusu, wu sǝn gǝ sau ar kǝra highiɓǝ ɗa patǝu, ǝnga culi nggyabiya ɗa, ba ǝnga sǝra yu nggya aga nyi, ǝnga mbǝrsa ɗa, ba ǝnga culi munya ɗa ǝnga yiwukur kǝra yu ca ba sǝsǝu sǝ ɗa. <verse eid="2TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11"/>Wu sǝn gǝ tsu culi ɓwaɓwatǝ pamǝpamǝ kǝra yi sǝsǝˈwuri wu mǝlmǝ Antakiya, ǝnga Ikoniyamu, ba ǝnga Lisǝtǝra, ama wu sǝˈyar kǝ patǝ kǝ Hyal hǝbiya ɗa a gwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12"/>Ənga jiri, kalar ndǝra wu yiwu ja nggya nǝ Hyalkur wu Kǝrsiti Yesu kǝl ji ɗari ɓwaɓwatǝ. <verse eid="2TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13"/>Ama nji batal ǝnga njir ngguta nji nǝr nda kǝl cakǝ nga ndu cakau wu ɗǝmwaˈyikur, ndu ngguta nji ǝnga nju ngguta nda tsu. <verse eid="2TI 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14"/>Ama nagǝ nǝ ngau, ga dumwa ǝnga highiɓǝ kǝra gǝ nggari ǝnga ga mbǝrsa ni, ara wu sǝni gǝ njira highiɓǝr ngǝ sǝˈyar kau. <verse eid="2TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15"/>Ga ɗǝngari ar pǝci kǝra gǝ tsu zǝr ǝnga ga vǝr highiɓǝ sǝra tsǝtsǝfǝ wu Lǝkakaɗǝ cicau nǝ Hyal, kǝra wu sǝn highiɓǝr ngǝ lagur uya mbǝɗau lagur mbǝrsa ǝnga Kǝrsiti Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16"/>Patǝkura sǝra tsǝtsǝfə wu Lǝkakaɗǝ cicau sǝra Hyal nana ngau, mǝnahǝ nga nyi aga highiɓau ǝnga aga kughi ǝnga fǝ sǝ wu lagu ba ǝnga hwathlǝ nju lagu tsapǝu, <verse eid="2TI 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17"/>aga kalar ndǝ nǝ Hyal ju ɗa hwahwathlau aga mǝl thlǝr wu kalar lagu kǝra mǝnahǝu.<verse eid="2TI 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1"/>Yu na anǝ ngau wu mwar Hyal ǝnga wu mwar Kǝrsiti Yesu, ndǝra wu sa mǝl numa anǝ njira ǝnga pi ba nji tǝtau, ǝnga ǝtsu ju sha shili ju sa ciya tǝlkur nyi. <verse eid="2TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2"/>Ga tǝtǝlna ndǝr Hyal, ga dumwa ni ar pǝci kǝra ja mǝsahǝu ǝnga pǝci kǝra ja aˈyi mǝsahǝ mai. Ga tǝɗar himiya nda, ǝnga ga kughiya nda, ba ǝnga tsu ga tsǝtsǝkur ɗǝfuwa nda lagur mba ɗǝfu ǝnga highiɓau. <verse eid="2TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3"/>Arya pǝci a vǝr shili kǝra nju nda sǝya himi anǝ highiɓǝ nǝ tsapǝ mai. Ama ar viya kau kǝl nu sǝra ɗǝfuwa nda wu yiwu, agabangǝ ndu kaɓiya malǝmǝ gangǝu kǝra wu nda nar nda kǝl sǝra himiya nda wu yiwu nda nggari wacu. <verse eid="2TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4"/>Ndu nda dari himiya nda ara nggari sǝra jiri ba nda dzǝgwa pahǝna himiya nda aga sǝhimi kǝbǝkwatǝ pampamǝu. <verse eid="2TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5"/>Ama nagǝ nǝ ngau, ga tsǝrpǝr kǝrngau mǝnahǝu wu kalar sau, ga sǝsǝˈwuri kalar ɓwaɓwatǝ, ǝnga ga mǝl thlǝr nǝ ndǝr tǝtǝlna ndǝr Hyal, ǝnga ga nyabiya thlǝr ngǝ cicipǝu ar viya mafa nǝ Hyal.<verse eid="2TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6"/>Arya nayi nǝ ɗa ya vǝr dumwa ǝnga pǝsau nǝ piya yau, ǝnga tsu pǝcir tǝ ɗa a ɗari lǝhǝu. <verse eid="2TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7"/>A panar yi pa kǝra mǝnahǝu, a hwinar yi hwi pǝra pǝra ɗa jamǝu, ǝnga tsu nayi pǝna mbǝrsa ɗa mai. <verse eid="2TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8"/>Kabangǝkau, akkǝri tsapǝu kǝra cabiya abǝr a pinar yi huɗa Hyal a vǝr sǝ kǝ ɗa. Thlagǝ ndǝr numa tsapǝ ngu sa nǝ ɗa akkǝri kau, ar pǝcir numa. Aˈyi anǝ ɗa nga ju sa lǝ akkǝri kǝ waci mai, ama anǝ kalar ndǝra vǝr sǝkǝ pǝcir shili nyi ǝnga huɗǝ hamǝu.<verse eid="2TI 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ndǝr Nǝ Tǝɗar Himiya Timathlawusu Sara Ara Bulusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9"/>Timathlawusu, ga nǝrdzau ga shili ǝgya yau ǝnga kusa. <verse eid="2TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10"/>Ara Dimasu a piyar ɗari arya ju yiwu sǝr duniya kǝ ji maˈyi a vu Tasalonika. Kǝrisensu a maˈyiri a vu ˈyiˈyir Galatiya, ǝnga Tayitusu tsu a maˈyiri ja a vu ˈyiˈyir Dalmatiya. <verse eid="2TI 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11"/>Kǝl Luka zhizhi nyi ngǝ hiyau ǝnga yau. Ga marma Markusu ma gu shili, ara naja ǝnga vala dzau anǝ ɗa wu thlǝr ɗa. <verse eid="2TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12"/>A sǝwari yi Tikikusu a vu Afisa. <verse eid="2TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13"/>Ar pǝci kǝra gu shili, ga mar ɗa gwada ɗa kǝra yi piyari wu tsa Kapusu wu mǝlmǝ Turuwasu, ga faˈari ɗa lǝkakaɗǝ ɗa a shili, majama nǝ ciˈyar ta. <verse eid="2TI 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14"/>Alegǝzanda ndǝr dlǝ liyangǝ ndzana thlǝr ɗa gagaɗau. Hyal Thlagǝu ngu nda kibiya sǝ kǝ ji mǝliya kau. <verse eid="2TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15"/>Nagǝ ma ga hangǝkal ǝnga ja, arya ju ca dawakur ǝnga cama kǝra mǝn shili ni kau.<verse eid="2TI 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16"/>Ar pǝci kǝra nji hǝr ɗa a shili wu mwar njir pathla, ndǝ aˈyi kǝra nu ɗa mai, ndǝ shini ɗa yi patǝu. Kǝdi Hyal ɗa, ca ngǝ ja tǝfǝbiya nda bikǝr nda patǝu. <verse eid="2TI 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17"/>Ama kǝ Thlagǝu nggya ǝnga yau, ji cakǝr ɗa dǝnama, aga lagu ɗa ngǝ ndǝshigu mǝsahǝ kau wu nda tǝtǝlnakǝr anǝ nji ar babal, aga njira aˈyi njir Yahudiya mai nda nggari tsu. Naja ngǝ hǝbiya ɗa sara wu miya tau wu miya lǝvari. <verse eid="2TI 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18"/>Thlagǝu wu nda hǝbiya ɗa sara wu kalar sǝ ɗǝmwaˈyu, ba ja hǝr ɗa jamǝu a shili wu tǝlkur nyi. A nǝ nyi ngǝ kadakadarkur baˈanuwa. Aminu.<verse eid="2TI 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Usa Dzǝ Nǝ Jamuya Ndǝl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19"/>Ga usar ɗa Pǝrsila ǝnga Akwila ba ǝnga njir ki Onesiforosu. <verse eid="2TI 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20"/>Irastusu nǝ nyi, tsu ja wu Kwaranthli, ǝnga yi piyari Tǝrafimusu a vu Miletusu gǝra ngga.<verse eid="2TI 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21"/>Ga nǝrdzau ga shili ǝnggau divira biyargwa. Yubulusu ǝnga Fudensu ǝnga Layinusu ba Kǝlaudiyasu ǝnga patǝr wazha ama nda a vǝr usa ngau.<verse eid="2TI 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22"/>Thlagǝu ja nggya ǝnga mambǝl ngau. Taˈyi mayiwakur a nggya ǝnga hyi.<verse eid="2TI 4:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4"/>
</usx>
